      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Ordering same-day flowers in London is simple. Browse our collection, choose your bouquet, and select Same-Day Delivery at checkout. As long as you order before 6pm, your flowers will be hand-delivered the same day. We cover all London postcodes, from Central London to the suburbs."
      }
    },

