      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How long do fresh cut flowers last?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Most fresh-cut flowers last 7–10 days with proper care. To maximise vase life: trim stems at a 45° angle under water, use a clean vase with fresh water and flower food, keep them away from direct sunlight and ripening fruit, and change the water every two days."
      }
    },

