      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What are the best flowers to send as a gift?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The best flowers for gifting depend on the occasion. Roses are a classic choice for romance and appreciation. Sunflowers and gerberas are cheerful and perfect for birthdays. For something more unusual, peonies and ranunculus make a lasting impression."
      }
    },

